From b8bdab5b7b8fdb08ae8fe2d70d273907f84908f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 10:21:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: mediatek: replace MT6797 DVFSP observer
 with handoff owner

Replace the earlier read-only observer contract with a deliberately narrow
receiver for a stopped MT6797 CPU-DVFS firmware instance. The receiver
validates the retained CSPM reset state and uses the common clock framework
to turn an untracked, ungated I2C_APPM clock into a tracked, gated state.

This is not a DVFSP coordination provider. It neither starts nor pauses the
firmware, and consumers such as I2C6 must remain disabled until a separate
experiment establishes the ownership transition.

Signed-off-by: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
